  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Kibewep.gif\" alt=\"Логотип\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Добавляет случайный анимированный эффект мигания к глазам Эндера и рамкам порталов в Энд. Также добавляется Мерцающее Серце Глубин!</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Поддерживаемые версии</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1.13.x - 1.20.x</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1.12.x (ПРИМЕЧАНИЕ: последний файл не будет работать, загрузите EnderEyes_backport.zip для поддержки 1.12)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Совместимость с модами</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endremastered\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Remastered</a>: Добавляет эффект мигания ко всем вариациям Глаза Эндера. Плюс стильная новая текстура!</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fI3I410P9Q1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"Купить мне кофе на ko-fi.com\" width=\"196\" height=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UV0z4K.png\" alt=\"Изображения\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o2D3D2f.gif\" alt=\"движущиеся картинки! ууууу\" width=\"2356\" height=\"1315\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/THwvk3p.png\" alt=\"Цикл мигания текстур предметов\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VtxZw0x.gif\" alt=\"End Remastered &amp; Сердце Глубин\" width=\"1436\" height=\"807\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iw1MIpK.png\" alt=\"Изображения\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/blinking-ender-eyes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZniwvvZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"63\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/baby-animals-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2eR3FW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mob-crates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrkE2a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-halloween-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PwGFKBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-fall-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BehR5p7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-default-style-christmas-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HTdgpYI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-winter-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sU8jEWl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mushrooms-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I44ugv6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/villager-ravager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vVFn56b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a></p>\n<p>Ретекстуры модов:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-3d-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bEDnkof.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gqxSiwm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smooth-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7k0IzpZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"315\"></a></p>",
